-- title:
--   $\ell$-adic cohomology computed on the big pro-étale site agrees with Mathlib's definition on the small site
-- statement:
--   Let $X$ be a scheme and $\ell$ a prime. On the **big pro-étale site** (all schemes, with the pro-étale topology) let $\mathbb Z[X]$ be the free abelian sheaf generated by $X$ and let $\underline{\mathbb Z_\ell}$ be the sheaf $U \mapsto \operatorname{Map}_{\mathrm{cont}}(U, \mathbb Z_\ell)$. On the **small pro-étale site** $X_{\text{proét}}$ of weakly étale $X$-schemes, let $H^n(X_{\text{proét}}, \mathbb Z_\ell)$ be the $\ell$-adic cohomology of $X$, i.e. the cohomology of the restriction of $\underline{\mathbb Z_\ell}$. Then for every $n \ge 0$ there is an isomorphism of abelian groups
--
--   $$
--   \operatorname{Ext}^n\bigl(\mathbb Z[X],\, \underline{\mathbb Z_\ell}\bigr) \;\cong\; H^n\bigl(X_{\text{proét}}, \mathbb Z_\ell\bigr),
--   $$
--
--   where the $\operatorname{Ext}$ group is computed in abelian sheaves on the big pro-étale site.
--
--   The left-hand side is the cohomology of $X$ with $\mathbb Z_\ell$-coefficients computed on the big site. The statement lets results proved for a big-site definition of $\ell$-adic cohomology be transported to Mathlib's definition, and therefore to the other statements of this mission.
--
--   **Formalization Note** The right-hand side is `X.EllAdicCohomology ℓ n`; the left-hand side is `Abelian.Ext (proetaleFreeSheaf X) (bigEllAdicSheaf ℓ) n`, with sheaves valued in `Ab.{u + 1}` for $X$ a `Scheme.{u}`. Only the existence of an additive isomorphism is asserted, not its compatibility with restriction maps.
-- source:
--   Not a result of the Bhatt–Scholze paper, which only uses the small site X_proét. Standard comparison of big and small sites; for schemes in universe 0 it is the abelian-sheaf part of `GlobalTheory.Et.Small.nonempty_equiv_ellAdicCohomology` in the original Alpöge–Claude formalization (mirrored at github.com/CocoSgt/riemann-hypothesis-lean, Lean v4.33.1, Mathlib 0df444a; published without a license), file src/Development/AbelianVarietyTheory/Proofs/SatakeParameters/NonemptyEquivEllAdicCohomology.lean.

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_ProEtale_BigProetaleSite

universe u
open CategoryTheory Limits AlgebraicGeometry

theorem AlgebraicGeometry.Scheme.nonempty_ext_proetaleFreeSheaf_bigEllAdicSheaf_addEquiv_ellAdicCohomology (X : Scheme.{u}) (ℓ : ℕ) [Fact ℓ.Prime] (n : ℕ) :
    Nonempty (Abelian.Ext.{u + 1} (proetaleFreeSheaf X) (bigEllAdicSheaf.{u} ℓ) n ≃+
      X.EllAdicCohomology ℓ n) := by sorry
